{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgmeakNSeseoRKMjueKzR","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Found it, I think. On the home page there's a box called \"להבין סוג של חיסכון\" with the line \"מה זה, כמה זה עולה ואיך זה ממוסה\", which was exactly what I wanted. It took me to a \"מדריך\" page where everything is in cards, and way down there's \"מדד S&P 500\", the thing everyone at work goes on about. The short line says it's 500 big American companies and the money goes in \"בדולרים דרך קרן שעוקבת אחריו\". I'm fairly sure, but I only read the short card, not the full page behind it.\n\nWhat made it click was the bit near the top, \"שני חלקים בכל חיסכון\". \"איפה הכסף מוחזק\" is like a קרן השתלמות or a \"חשבון ניירות ערך\". \"במה הכסף מושקע\" is the S&P part. So the S&P isn't somewhere you put money; it's what the money sits in. I didn't know that.\n\n**Where I looked, in order:**\n- **Home page:** the big \"מקור\" heading. The form on the right, \"מה השאלה שלכם?\" with the ₪ boxes, I skipped, because I wanted an explanation, not to type my numbers in. I took the \"להבין סוג של חיסכון\" box on the left.\n- **Below that on the home page:** I glanced at \"שאלות שכולם שואלים\" (just tax questions) and the footer.\n- **מדריך page:**\n  - The \"שני חלקים\" bit, the top of \"מאיפה להתחיל\" and the heading \"איפה הכסף מוחזק\".\n  - I stopped on the \"קרן השתלמות\" card because I already have one; it says you can take the money out tax-free after a while.\n  - Then I scrolled past \"פרישה\", \"לילדים\" and \"לבחירה עצמית\" to \"במה הכסף מושקע\" and found the S&P card. I only read headings on the other cards.\n\n**Words I didn't get:** מק\"מ (it's everywhere), אג\"ח צמודה / לא צמודה, \"קופת גמל להשקעה\", \"מסלול כללי\", MSCI World / MSCI AC World, \"קרן כספית\", \"מנוטרלת\" (it was cut off at the top of a screen).\n\n**What bugged me:**\n- There are way too many cards. I count about 25, all looking the same, and nothing says \"start here if you're a regular employee\". Halfway down I was already bored.\n- The S&P card is almost at the bottom. If I hadn't been looking for it by name I'd have quit before getting there.\n- There's no fee anywhere in shekels, so I still don't know what this costs me.\n- The search box on the home page sits on the left and I nearly missed it. I only saw it after the cards."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5605,"cache_read_input_tokens":11837,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":5605},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0bb11228-037f-465d-aa27-bc8b49d82beb","uuid":"40494917-0201-4191-901e-761106de43f5","timestamp":"2026-11-06T12:09:03.428Z","request_id":"req_011CgmeakAoK83pTKJBrR57m"}
